IMPORTANT NOTICE REGARDING PROCESS TERMINATION FUNCTIONALITY:

CyberGuard AI includes functionality that can terminate ("kill") operating system
processes. This capability is a core security feature designed for authorized use
by system administrators and security professionals to eliminate detected threats.

By using this software, you acknowledge and agree that:

1. You are solely responsible for configuring appropriate kill protection rules
   to safeguard critical system processes.

2. You are solely responsible for any consequences resulting from process
   termination, including but not limited to service interruptions, data loss,
   or system instability.

3. You will not use this software to terminate processes on systems you do not
   own or have explicit written authorization to manage.

4. The authors and copyright holders expressly disclaim any liability for
   damages caused by unauthorized, accidental, or misconfigured process
   termination.

This software is intended for legitimate cybersecurity purposes only. Use
responsibly and in compliance with all applicable laws and regulations in
your jurisdiction.
